---
layout: base.njk
title: Arcade
description: "Browser games library: solo games playable on the arcade, LAN games with honest server notes."
---
<div class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">02 · Arcade</p>
  <h1>Game library.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Solo games run on the arcade; LAN games need a Python server on your Wi-Fi, so this shelf links out instead of pretending to embed them. Play + source live at <a href="{{ site.arcadeUrl }}">browser-games ↗</a> and <a href="{{ site.gamesRepo }}">the games repo ↗</a>.</p>
</div>

<div class="filter-row" role="search">
  <label for="q">Filter</label>
  <input id="q" type="search" data-filter-search placeholder="e.g. pong, solo, lan…" autocomplete="off">
  <button class="chip" data-filter-chip="solo" aria-pressed="false">solo</button>
  <button class="chip" data-filter-chip="lan" aria-pressed="false">lan</button>
</div>

<ol style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0">
{% for g in games %}
  <li class="entry" data-filter-item="{{ g.title }} {{ g.players }} {{ g.kind }} {{ g.blurb }}">
    <div class="entry-top">
      <span class="entry-index">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}/</span>
      <h2 class="entry-title">{{ g.title }}</h2>
      <span class="stamp {{ g.status }}">{{ g.status }}</span>
      {% if g.version %}<span class="tag">v{{ g.version }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="blurb">{{ g.blurb }}</p>
    <p class="entry-meta"><span>{{ g.players }}</span><span>{{ g.dir }}</span></p>
    <p class="btn-row">
      {% if g.site %}<a class="btn" href="{{ g.site }}">play ↗</a>{% endif %}
      <a class="btn" href="{{ g.repo }}">repo ↗</a>
    </p>
    <details>
      <summary>Controls &amp; how to run</summary>
      <p class="controls">{{ g.controls }}. Source folder <code>{{ g.dir }}</code> in <a href="{{ g.repo }}">the repo ↗</a>. {% if g.site %}Also playable at <a href="{{ g.site }}">the arcade ↗</a>.{% else %}Run the folder's server script, then open the printed LAN URL on both devices.{% endif %}</p>
    </details>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>
